  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Preparation Facility for Municipal Infrastructure to Support the Earthquake Recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Project Preparation Facility for Municipal Infrastructure to Support the Earthquake Recovery - The main objective of this Action is to further increase and consolidate management capacity of the Turkish administrations for increasing the efficiency and effectiveness of the EU financial assistance to T&#xfc;rkiye. Specifically, the managerial and technical capacity of the NIPAC office, NAO and other relevant institutions will be strengthened to ensure overall coordination of strategic planning, the new programming framework, implementation, monitoring, evaluation and reporting of EU assistance under the national IPA (Instrument for Pre-Accession Assistance) programme. This intervention will operate in the transition period from 2014-2020 to 2021-2027 perspective, which will allow triangulation of experiences and lessons learned from the implementation of the previous financial assistance and use those to address more demanding future financial assistance framework</narrative>
  </description>
